~$*.docx

# Governance / funding / strategy documents — see CLAUDE.md -> "Do NOT publish".
#
# This repository is PUBLIC on two forges. These directories accumulate exactly the
# categories that must not be published: real-person conflict-of-interest data, dollar
# figures and compensation, pre-counsel drafts of legal instruments, and non-public
# funder or partner posture. Their home is ~/dev/steppe-private/.
#
# Broadened from `*.docx` to the whole directories on 2026-07-31. The previous entries
# excluded only the Word copies, for diffability — a formatting concern that never asked
# whether the content belonged in a public repo at all.
#
# ⚠ WHAT THIS DOES AND DOES NOT DO. It stops FUTURE files in these directories from being
# added by accident. It does NOT untrack anything already tracked — gitignore has no effect
# on paths already in the index — and it does not unpublish anything already committed.
# Do not read these lines as a fix for what is already there; the already-tracked documents
# are a separate, per-document decision.
#
# Legitimate public additions here (e.g. a ballot draft or the moderation policy, where
# publication is the point) still work: force-add with `git add -f <file>`.
docs/governance/
docs/funding/
docs/strategy/
# (Other .docx — e.g. docs/brand/word/steppe-reference.docx — remain tracked.)

# Stray pandoc/weasyprint intermediates (delete locally: rm -f docs/html2pdf*)
docs/html2pdf*

# macOS
.DS_Store
